project/editor-uncovered-polish: spoint in-engine editor surfaces not covered by the docked-panel/crossscreen passes (kit anentrypoint-design >=0.0.184, consumed via unpkg @latest, witnessed live against published kit). (1) The inspector vec3 scrub-cell (dragNumberVNode wrapper) must NOT carry the kit `.row` class — `.ds-247420 .row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto !important}` is a responsive utility whose !important grid hijacks the cell and pins the text input to its ~36px min-content, clipping `0.000`->`0.`/`-0`. Use a dedicated `.ds-ep-vec3-cell` span (`display:grid;grid-template-columns:9px minmax(0,1fr);width:100%`); inputs then fill to ~80px and show full 3-decimal values. Diagnosed by measuring the width chain live — computed gridTemplateColumns showed `9px 36px` despite a 91px cell. (2) showToast routes through the kit `.ds-ep-toast` in a `.ds-247420 .ds-ep-toast-host` (dense bordered strip, accent border-left), never `.panel .panel-inline` (the dashboard card). (3) App-prop `propField` (EditPanelDOM.js) renders `.ds-ep-propfield`+`.ds-ep-propfield-label`+`.ds-ep-propfield-value` with `.ds-input-bare`/`.ds-input-color`/`.ds-input-check`, NOT `C.PropertyField`; the color swatch + checkbox need a `.ds-ep-propfield-value input.ds-input-color/check{width;flex:0 0 auto}` specificity bump or the generic `.ds-ep-propfield-value input{width:100%}` stretches them full-width. (4) HookFlowViewer empty-state must be a centered DOM `C.EmptyState` overlay inside `.ds-hf-stage`, NOT an SVG `<text x=W/2>` — when the HookFlow tab is hidden at first render `container.offsetWidth` is 0 so W falls back to 600 and the text is placed at x=300, overflowing the ~314px inspector column and clipping `No app entitie[s]` off the right edge. (5) editor-primitives.css now also carries a thin themed scrollbar (`scrollbar-width:thin`+`::-webkit-scrollbar` 8px var(--rule) thumb) on docked panels and a tree drag-reparent highlight keyed on the kit useDropTarget `[data-drop-target-active]` attribute (interaction-primitives.js sets it) + `[data-dragging]` source opacity — not a `.drag-over` class. Witness: cache-disabled reload (Network.setCacheDisabled via CDP) + bust query, because ES modules cache per-URL; the spoint server serves client/ at prefix `/` (StaticHandler mtime-keyed fileCache) so the path is `/editor/EditPanelDOM.js` not `/client/editor/...`.